### Level 8 - ore for the trapper
Mountain Man	quest:questL08Trapper<2	prop_boolean:auto_mountainManWantCopy	js:itemAmount(Item.get(get("trapperOre"))) < 3
### The Cyrpt
Swarm of Ghuol Whelps	prop:cyrptCrannyEvilness>17
### Level 11 - Hidden City pygmies
pygmy witch accountant	loc:The Hidden Office Building	item:McClusky file (complete)<1	item:McClusky file (page 5)<1	!prop:questL11Business=finished
pygmy witch accountant	loc:The Hidden Apartment Building	effect:Thrice-Cursed	item:McClusky file (complete)<1	item:McClusky file (page 5)<1	!prop:questL11Business=finished
Pygmy Bowler	js:get("hiddenBowlingAlleyProgress") + itemAmount($item`bowling ball`) < 6
### Level 11 - Palindome book and photograph
# only the dudes we fight inside the Palindome count towards either drop
# wait for the other three photographs, before that we'll let the zone hand us Bobs on its own
Racecar Bob	loc:Inside the Palindome	quest:questL11Palindome<=0	js:$items`photograph of a red nugget, photograph of an ostrich egg, photograph of God`.every(it => have(it))
Bob Racecar	loc:Inside the Palindome	quest:questL11Palindome<=0	js:$items`photograph of a red nugget, photograph of an ostrich egg, photograph of God`.every(it => have(it))
### Level 13 - stars and lines for the star key
Camel's Toe	item:star<7	item:line<6	js:!get("nsTowerDoorKeysUsed").includes("star key") && !have($item`Richard's star key`)
Skinflute	item:star<7	item:line<6	js:!get("nsTowerDoorKeysUsed").includes("star key") && !have($item`Richard's star key`)
